    "cli.cmd.locations.abstract" : {
      "en" : "Xcode ▸ Settings ▸ Locations (DerivedData, Archives, compilation cache): Apple's own setting; the setters here are experimental. set-derived-data-split keeps built test products on this Mac.",
      "es" : "Xcode ▸ Ajustes ▸ Ubicaciones (DerivedData, Archives, caché de compilación): el ajuste propio de Apple; los comandos set de aquí son experimentales. set-derived-data-split deja los productos de prueba compilados en este Mac.",
      "ja" : "Xcode ▸ 設定 ▸ 場所（DerivedData、Archives、コンパイルキャッシュ）— Apple 自身の設定。ここでの set コマンドは実験的です。set-derived-data-split はビルドしたテスト成果物をこの Mac に残します。",
      "pt-BR" : "Xcode ▸ Ajustes ▸ Localizações (DerivedData, Archives, cache de compilação): o ajuste da própria Apple; os comandos set daqui são experimentais. set-derived-data-split mantém os produtos de teste compilados neste Mac.",
      "zh-Hans" : "Xcode ▸ 设置 ▸ 位置（DerivedData、Archives、编译缓存）— Apple 自己的设置；这里的 set 命令是实验性的。set-derived-data-split 将构建的测试产品留在这台 Mac 上。"
    },
    "cli.cmd.locations.resetArchives.abstract" : {
