    "cli.root.discussion" : {
      "en" : "Read commands (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) are always safe and never change anything. Every read command supports --json.\n\nStrategies marked \"(exp.)\" / experimental have not met the Definition of Done in docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md for your macOS/Xcode combination.\n\nExperiment IDs that appear in help text (E2, E8b, E11 …) are defined in docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nLanguage: --lang <code> (%@) or XCODEVAULT_LANG; otherwise your macOS language. --json output and report are never translated.",
      "es" : "Los comandos de lectura (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) son siempre seguros y nunca cambian nada. Todos los comandos de lectura admiten --json.\n\nLas estrategias marcadas con \"(exp.)\" / experimental aún no cumplen la Definición de Hecho de docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md para tu combinación de macOS/Xcode.\n\nLos ID de experimento que aparecen en la ayuda (E2, E8b, E11 …) se definen en docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nIdioma: --lang <código> (%@) o XCODEVAULT_LANG; si no, el idioma de tu macOS. La salida --json y report nunca se traducen.",
      "ja" : "読み取りコマンド（scan、status、plan、report、doctor、xcode、runtime list、volumes、journal、compatibility、permissions）は常に安全で、何も変更しません。すべての読み取りコマンドは --json に対応しています。\n\n「(exp.)」または実験的と表示された方式は、お使いの macOS/Xcode の組み合わせで docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md の完了の定義をまだ満たしていません。\n\nヘルプに出てくる実験 ID（E2、E8b、E11 など）は docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md で定義されています。\n\n言語: --lang <コード>（%@）または XCODEVAULT_LANG。指定がなければ macOS の言語を使います。--json の出力と report は翻訳されません。",
      "pt-BR" : "Os comandos de leitura (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) são sempre seguros e nunca alteram nada. Todo comando de leitura aceita --json.\n\nEstratégias marcadas com \"(exp.)\" / experimental ainda não atendem à Definição de Pronto em docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md para a sua combinação de macOS/Xcode.\n\nOs IDs de experimento que aparecem na ajuda (E2, E8b, E11 …) são definidos em docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nIdioma: --lang <código> (%@) ou XCODEVAULT_LANG; caso contrário, o idioma do seu macOS. A saída --json e o report nunca são traduzidos.",
      "zh-Hans" : "读取命令（scan、status、plan、report、doctor、xcode、runtime list、volumes、journal、compatibility、permissions）始终安全，不会更改任何内容。所有读取命令都支持 --json。\n\n标记为“(exp.)”或实验性的方案，在你的 macOS/Xcode 组合上尚未达到 docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md 中的完成定义。\n\n帮助中出现的实验编号（E2、E8b、E11 等）定义于 docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md。\n\n语言：--lang <代码>（%@）或 XCODEVAULT_LANG；否则使用 macOS 的语言。--json 输出和 report 从不翻译。"
    },
